 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "Relative dualizing complex",
 "statement": "For smooth $f:X\\to Y$ and any admissible $\\Lambda$, the *relative dualizing\ncomplex* is\n\n$$\n\\omega_{f,\\Lambda}=f_\\Lambda^!\\Lambda_Y\\in\\Dctf(X,\\Lambda).\n$$\n\nFor finite coefficients $\\omega_{f,\\Lambda}$ can be computed on the pro-étale\nsite or, equivalently, on the étale site ([sk-prop-sp-et-proet]).",
